{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39275","headline":"云散 · 韦庄","name":"云散","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云散天边落照和，关关春树鸟声多。\n刘伶避世唯沈醉，甯戚伤时亦浩歌。\n已恨岁华添皎镜，更悲人事逐颓波。\n青云自有鵷鸿待，莫说他山好薜萝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39275.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39275","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}